#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:19
msgid "Operation Type"
msgstr "نوع عملیات"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:37
msgid ""
"Rounds the current prices using the rounding options below without "
"changing them otherwise."
msgstr ""
"قیمت‌های فعلی را فقط با گزینه‌های گرد کردن زیر گرد می‌کند و تغییر دیگری "
"نمی‌دهد."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:40
msgid ""
"The sale price becomes the regular price and the sale is removed. Only "
"products with a sale price are affected."
msgstr ""
"قیمت حراج به قیمت اصلی تبدیل می‌شود و حراج برداشته می‌شود. فقط محصولاتی "
"که قیمت حراج دارند تحت تأثیر قرار می‌گیرند."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:43
msgid ""
"Changes only the sale price, by a percentage or fixed amount of the "
"current sale price. Only products with a sale price are affected."
msgstr ""
"فقط قیمت حراج را با درصد یا مقدار ثابتی از قیمت حراج فعلی تغییر می‌دهد. "
"فقط محصولاتی که قیمت حراج دارند تحت تأثیر قرار می‌گیرند."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:48
msgid "Change Amount"
msgstr "مقدار تغییر"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:52
msgid "Percentage (%)"
msgstr "درصد (%)"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:53
msgid "e.g. 10"
msgstr "مثلاً 10"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:56
msgid "Fixed Amount"
msgstr "عدد ثابت"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:57
msgid "e.g. 5000"
msgstr "مثلاً 5000"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:61
msgid "Only one"
msgstr "فقط یکی"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:61
msgid ""
"of the two fields above should be filled. If both are filled, no changes "
"will be applied."
msgstr ""
"از دو فیلد بالا را پر کنید. اگر هر دو پر شوند، هیچ تغییری اعمال نخواهد شد."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:66
msgid "New Price"
msgstr "قیمت جدید"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:68
msgid "e.g. 12000"
msgstr "مثلاً 12000"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:70
msgid "Every selected product gets exactly this price."
msgstr "همه محصولات انتخاب‌شده دقیقاً همین قیمت را می‌گیرند."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:74
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "تنظیمات پیشرفته"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:78
msgid "Product Filter:"
msgstr "فیلتر محصولات:"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:78
msgid "Process only products currently on sale"
msgstr "فقط محصولات تخفیف‌دار فعلی را پردازش کن"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:82
msgid "Sync Sale Price:"
msgstr "همگام‌سازی قیمت حراج:"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:82
msgid "When changing regular price, also change sale price proportionally"
msgstr "در تغییر قیمت اصلی، قیمت حراج هم به همان نسبت تغییر کند"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:84
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the discount percentage stays constant and the "
"sale price changes accordingly."
msgstr ""
"با فعال بودن این گزینه، درصد تخفیف ثابت باقی می‌ماند و قیمت حراج متناسب "
"تغییر می‌کند."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:85
msgid ""
"Example: If discount was 20%, it will remain 20% after the regular price "
"change."
msgstr ""
"مثال: اگر تخفیف 20% بود، بعد از تغییر قیمت اصلی همچنان 20% باقی می‌ماند."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:91
msgid "Category"
msgstr "دسته‌بندی"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:97
msgid "All Categories"
msgstr "همه دسته‌ها"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:105
msgid "Price Rounding"
msgstr "گرد کردن قیمت"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:108
msgid "No rounding (store decimals)"
msgstr "بدون گرد کردن (اعشار فروشگاه)"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:109
msgid "Round to the nearest multiple of…"
msgstr "گرد کردن به نزدیک‌ترین مضرب…"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:110
msgid "Round up to a multiple of…"
msgstr "گرد کردن به بالا تا مضرب…"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:111
msgid "Round down to a multiple of…"
msgstr "گرد کردن به پایین تا مضرب…"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:112
msgid "Make prices end in…"
msgstr "قیمت‌ها به این رقم ختم شوند…"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:115
msgid "e.g. 1000"
msgstr "مثلاً 1000"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:118
msgid "e.g. 99, .99 or 900"
msgstr "مثلاً 99، 0.99 یا 900"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:121
msgid ""
"Example: a step of 1000 turns 12,340 into 12,000 (nearest), 13,000 (up) "
"or 12,000 (down)."
msgstr ""
"مثال: با گام 1000، مبلغ 12,340 به 12,000 (نزدیک‌ترین)، 13,000 (به بالا) "
"یا 12,000 (به پایین) تبدیل می‌شود."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:124
msgid ""
"Example: \".99\" turns 19.60 into 19.99; \"900\" turns 12,340 into "
"11,900; \"99\" turns 1,234 into 1,199. Uses the closest price with that "
"ending."
msgstr ""
"مثال: «0.99» مبلغ 19.60 را به 19.99 تبدیل می‌کند؛ «900» مبلغ 12,340 را به "
"11,900 و «99» مبلغ 1,234 را به 1,199. نزدیک‌ترین قیمت با همان رقم پایانی "
"انتخاب می‌شود."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:129
msgid "Price Limits"
msgstr "محدودیت قیمت"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:133
msgid "Never lower a price below"
msgstr "قیمت هرگز پایین‌تر از این مقدار نرود"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:134
msgid "No minimum"
msgstr "بدون حداقل"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:137
msgid "Never raise a price above"
msgstr "قیمت هرگز بالاتر از این مقدار نرود"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:138
msgid "No maximum"
msgstr "بدون حداکثر"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:142
msgid ""
"Protects against going too low or too high. A product already outside the "
"limit is left as it is, never pushed further."
msgstr ""
"از رفتن قیمت به مقدار خیلی کم یا خیلی زیاد جلوگیری می‌کند. محصولی که از "
"قبل خارج از این محدوده باشد همان‌طور می‌ماند و بیشتر از آن جابه‌جا "
"نمی‌شود."

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:147
msgid "Sale Start Date"
msgstr "تاریخ شروع حراج"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:150
msgid "For 'Apply Sale Price' operation, you can set a start date"
msgstr "برای عملیات \"اعمال قیمت حراج\" می‌توانید تاریخ شروع تعیین کنید"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:154
msgid "Sale End Date"
msgstr "تاریخ پایان حراج"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:157
msgid "For 'Apply Sale Price' operation, you can set an expiry date"
msgstr "برای عملیات \"اعمال قیمت حراج\" می‌توانید تاریخ انقضا تعیین کنید"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:161
msgid "When to Apply"
msgstr "زمان اعمال"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:165
msgid "Apply immediately after confirming"
msgstr "بلافاصله پس از تایید اعمال شود"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:169
msgid "Schedule for later"
msgstr "زمان‌بندی برای بعد"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:177
msgid "Auto-Restore"
msgstr "بازگردانی خودکار"

#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:181
msgid ""
"Optional. Automatically put the original prices back at this time — handy "
"for time-limited campaigns."
msgstr ""
"اختیاری. در این زمان قیمت‌های اصلی به‌طور خودکار بازگردانده می‌شود — "
"مناسب کمپین‌های زمان‌دار."

#. translators: %s: site timezone, e.g. Asia/Tehran
#: admin/views/partials/form-fields.php:186
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Times use the site timezone (%s). Scheduled changes run through "
"WooCommerce's Action Scheduler, which needs site visits or a server cron "
"to fire."
msgstr ""
"زمان‌ها بر اساس منطقه زمانی سایت (%s) هستند. تغییرات زمان‌بندی‌شده از "
"طریق Action Scheduler ووکامرس اجرا می‌شوند که برای اجرا به بازدید سایت یا "
"کران‌جاب سرور نیاز دارد."

